ading and owes her money. He's abusive, nasty, annoying, irresponsible. She hates him. Jane advises her to get rid of him. She's afraid of asking him to leave because it will only cause another fight. Jane advises her to cut her losses and move on. She's afraid of doing it. Jane believes in her and advises her to do it. She's always there for her. \n\n\nDialogue: Jen: I think I'm through with the dickhead. He's"}
